[statement]
As `a-condition-that-will-hold-steers-an-earlier-choice`, with `e`'s
condition naming two packages, each the one candidate for a name `top`
needs: the walk reaches `e` through `base` before `cc` is chosen, and the
choice of `cc` completes the condition later. `s1`, which `e` needs, holds
`K`, so `F`, decided first, takes `f2`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z B C

P:base
V:1
p:B=1

P:cc
V:1
p:C=1

P:z
V:1
D:F

P:e
V:1
i:base cc
D:S

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
p:S=1 K=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install f2 1
install z 1
install base 1
install cc 1
install s1 1
install e 1
install top 1
